  "notes": "USAGE:\n{通話|つうわ} is used in both everyday and technical/business contexts. It refers specifically to voice communication, as opposed to text messaging or data use.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {通話|つうわ}⟦{料金|りょうきん}→料金：03797_ryoukin⟧ (call charges)\n- {通話|つうわ}⟦{中|ちゅう}→〜中：09840_chuu⟧ (during a call, on the phone)\n- {通話|つうわ}⟦{時間|じかん}→時間：00468_jikan⟧ (call duration)\n- {通話|つうわ}⟦{履歴|りれき}→履歴：09334_rireki⟧ (call history)\n- ⟦{無料|むりょう}→無料：01662_muryou⟧{通話|つうわ} (free calls)\n- {通話|つうわ}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{切|き}る→切る：02693_kiru⟧ (to end/hang up a call)\n\n{通話|つうわ} is the standard word used by phone carriers and in plan descriptions.",
